<%# Opening a duel: what it is about, then the button.

    The categories are chips rather than a multi-select, because the whole list
    has to be readable at a glance by a child deciding between „каквото и да е"
    and „дроби". Folded away, and picking none is the default and means
    anything — so the fast path is still one press, which is what it was before
    categories existed.

    Only the categories this student has problems in are listed. See
    DuelCategories: the bank is not square, and offering „Тригонометрия" to a
    nine-year-old buys them a match against the question bank rather than
    against another child. %>
<%= form_with url: challenges_path, method: :post, class: "contents" do %>
  <div class="duel-hero-row">
    <%= render "hero_text" %>
    <%= submit_tag "#{t('challenges.find_opponent')} →",
                   class: "button-edge button-edge-white min-h-[58px] shrink-0 px-7 text-[17px]" %>
  </div>

  <details class="duel-opener">
    <summary>
      <span class="text-[13px] font-black uppercase tracking-[.08em]"><%= t("duel.pick_categories") %></span>
      <span class="text-[12.5px] font-bold opacity-80"><%= t("duel.pick_categories_hint") %></span>
    </summary>

    <div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
      <% categories.each do |category| %>
        <label class="duel-chip">
          <%= check_box_tag "topic_ids[]", category.id, false, id: "category-#{category.id}", class: "sr-only" %>
          <span><%= category.name %></span>
        </label>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </details>
<% end %>
